sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If a number multiplied by two numbers makes certain numbers, then the numbers so produced have the same ratio as the numbers multiplied.
----
proof:

Let the number {A} multiplied by the two numbers {B} and {C} make {D} and {E}.

I say that {B} is to {C} as {D} is to {E}.

